---
// 01 — The Real Problem
---
<section class="problem section" id="problem">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow reveal"><span class="frame-mark"></span> <span class="num">01</span> &nbsp;The Real Problem</p>

    <div class="problem-grid">
      <div class="problem-head reveal">
        <span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h2 class="display">
          Before anyone will buy your product, they must first <em>buy into your story.</em>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <p class="problem-body reveal">
        When ads aren't converting, social is flat, and investors aren't hopping on board —
        the real problem is that they can't see the value. The brand story isn't landing.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem { background: var(--bg-deep); }
  .problem-grid {
    margin-top: 54px;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr; gap: 0 clamp(30px, 6vw, 90px);
    align-items: end;
  }
  .problem-head { position: relative; padding-left: 30px; }
  .problem-head .rule {
    position: absolute; left: 0; top: 6px; bottom: 6px; width: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(var(--ember), var(--ember-deep));
    box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(245,130,46,.6);
  }
  .problem-head h2 { font-size: clamp(30px, 4.3vw, 58px); line-height: 1.08; }
  .problem-body {
    font-weight: 300; font-size: clamp(15px, 1.3vw, 17px); line-height: 1.8; color: var(--muted);
    padding-bottom: 10px; max-width: 40ch;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .problem-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 34px; }
  }
</style>
